    <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 12:17:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p></p><p><span>主播 | Roger &amp; Tony</span></p><p><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>波士顿和马拉松</span></p></li><li><p><span>Summit</span></p></li><li><p><span>Empire State Building</span></p></li><li><p><span>Broadway / Moulin Rouge</span></p></li><li><p><span>自由女神</span></p></li><li><p><span>9·11纪念馆</span></p></li><li><p><span>联合国</span></p></li><li><p><span>The Met 大都会博物馆</span></p></li><li><p><span>Brooklyn Bridge park run</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>Soundtrack：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>片头片尾曲- 《誰も彼も何処も何も知らない / I dont know&nbsp; anyone anywhere》</span></p></li><li><p><span>插曲- 《Lady Marmalade》 Christina Aguilera  <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2302">00:38:22</a> </span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>波士顿心碎坡小店</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhU2wb7V4Q0QkVVvkO-Jbyi9kS88.jpg"></figure><p><span>来自美国马拉松一姐Keira D'Amato的祝福</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqTla_fELSvsAomIj5WOsYObIOww.jpg"></figure><p><span>波马特色，排队坐校车到起点</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnrLaSuiMRo0dYu0YVkE0ORMJlT4.jpg"></figure><p><span>帝国大厦看出去的曼哈顿夜景</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiiuV00zvM7QiOYP-OmuGw8_bDsx.jpg"></figure><p><span>红磨坊，中间的是本场限定</span><strong><span>Megan Thee Stallion</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq3_hFZ56vFUR5aYqKAUJ7TRCnmy.jpg"></figure><p><span>911纪念馆内</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgGkKWTmD-gQiYqc6WtVBQ4iZxEl.jpg"></figure><p><span>大都会博物馆内的丹铎神庙</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvW3WWUk988h1kcymhbiUCCwvs-m.jpg"></figure><p><span>一看就知道今年是马年</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fko6Ew_ARVYigqFQ6li4_ua6A1KM.jpg"></figure><p><span>这次拉斐尔特展借来的《The Alba Madonna》</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8aRpy6FfrZYLq2_-S-hZFjYfrE.jpg"></figure><p><span>Centrel Perk Cafe内的沙发</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn_J6HyuncPqkPpdAmxWIntIYXhu.jpg"></figure><p><span>布鲁克林跳蚤市场</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FngqtBQpkfma_0h6V3bjfuIYdnUZ.jpg"></figure><p><span>时代广场董小姐</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvNqN13MNsCl9PjfthvjZ4g-Pb1q.jpg"></figure><p></p>]]></description>
