    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播 | Roger &amp; Tony</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>“What's your name, man?” “Alexander Hamilton”</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>“Who lives, who dies, who tells your story?”</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>你喜欢音乐剧吗?</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期Tony和Roger给大家分享一下看音乐剧的经历，以及音乐剧这个艺术表演形式的小知识</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>- 歌剧，音乐剧，话剧 的不同</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 什么是原创剧组和全球巡演</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 看剧礼仪</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 音乐剧的经济效益</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 关于场地和买票技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span>- Tony分享看剧经历和经典推荐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>乐单：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲: 《誰も彼も何処も何も知らない》 - ASOBI同盟</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲1/片尾曲: Hamilton</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲2: Nessun dorma</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲3: Sunset Boulevard</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲4: Chicago - All That Jazz</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲5: Hamilton - My Shot</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲6: The Phantom of the Opera</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲7: Mamma Mia</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲8: Wicked - Defying Gravity</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲9: As If We Never Said Goodbye</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>*** 更正：《Hamilton》现正在位于Sydney Star内的Lyric theatre上演 （不是ICC）***</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播手机相册里的照片：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>哈里波特-被诅咒的孩子</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnmfW3KvV636FBwFcheTLFHENo2n.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpCQqKEZUnV7sxXoDiVz_EL1YqHM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>芝加哥</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrmxvVA9-qhugRJ6GC4zcsQWEwge.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>红磨坊</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlIwri5GteiJFn59EIC6OTCN5QmT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>汉密尔顿</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo2Ykt9rYoW3_csa50P3oS54Sj91.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiHm3Fp5qb8Dm32Sr1hZrgwgoKV2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lriW-uhtpei8uZEcdm3F24sgndBU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>歌剧魅影</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvwMJswcQ0aep_wHah-JiusNeeat.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>魔法坏女巫</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs_1zHMrEWhwK276N-KY5lb5q8Og.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnnoCQGCvRc4OeQiv-00Bj3ClXW4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>日落大道</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrqHlLBP91iWlP-5Hb4kraY8cwRe.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhvQrVlBoa3kEQMu3oKnkdLBa9pY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoGdi33FiVNyDBlLpPForptOuQYL.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
